{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54466","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"参彼将，德（京本作「得」）性好攻心。\n仔细究情（辛本作「精」）随彼好，中行离[反]（问）（据辛本、京本改）诡相亲，设利诱前擒。\n（覆兵败将，攻其便，究其情，伐其机。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}